				"description": "{Dual Form}\n\nThe Fate Spinner takes spider form: number, Hit Points and position are unchanged, ability uses so far carry over, and spell effects, creature experience and ability states are all kept. Changing form counts as waiting: the new form acts after all stacks yet to act this turn. Cannot change again during the 1-round cooldown. After battle, the army holds the form it started the battle in; outside battle, Fate Spinners and Fate Weavers in a hero's army can switch form for free at any time with the \"Upgrade\" button in the creature window."
